  "body": "## What changed\n\n- Added off-screen `ShellUi` + `View3D` guide capture harness in `crates/ui/src/egui_app/tests/guide_images.rs`.\n- Added three clean-room demo project builders in `crates/ui/src/egui_app/tests/guide_projects.rs` and committed `examples/guide-workholding.camproj`, `examples/guide-3d.camproj`, and `examples/guide-multiaxis.camproj`.\n- Added `cargo xtask docs-images [--check]` in `xtask/src/docs_images.rs` and wired it into `xtask/src/main.rs`.\n- Rendered and committed 13 optimised 1200x760 guide PNGs in `site/static/images/guide/` (`setup-overview.png`, `workholding-vise-toolpath.png`, `op-2d-pocket-params.png`, `op-2d-{stepover,entry,lead}-{before,after}.png`, `op-3d-pocket-roughing.png`, `op-3d-finish-parallel.png`, `op-multiaxis-swarf.png`, `op-indexed-3plus2.png`).\n- Embedded all 13 images with descriptive alt text across Setups, Workholding, 2D, 3D, Multi-axis, and Indexed guide pages.\n- Added `.guide-content img` and `.guide-pair` layout rules in `site/static/style.css`.\n- Added `site/tests/test_guide_images.py`, `xtask/tests/docs_images.rs`, and `docs/decisions/1902-docs-guide-images.md`.\n\n## Cause\n\nThe User Guide relied solely on SVG path diagrams without screenshots of CamCraft's UI, setup tree, workholding fixtures, 3D views, or parameter before/after pairs.\n\n## Tests\n\n- Pinning tests (red before fix, green after fix):\n  - `cargo test -p xtask --test docs_images`: failed 3 tests before fix (`help_lists_docs_images_command`, `docs_images_check_verifies_guide_pngs_and_manifest`, `docs_images_refuses_unknown_option_by_name`); passes 4 after fix.\n  - `cargo test -p xtask docs_images`: 3 unit tests (`short_alt_text_is_refused`, `narrow_png_width_is_refused`, `corrupt_png_header_is_refused`) + 3 filtered integration tests passed.\n- Verification after final edit:\n  - `cargo test -p camcraft-ui --lib -- guide_`: 2 passed, 1 ignored (`demo_projects_build_and_load_with_valid_paths`, `guide_image_manifest_has_expected_entries`; `render_all_guide_images` ignored outside `docs-images`).\n  - `cargo test -p xtask`: 140 unit + 4 `docs_images` + 3 `merge_ready_skill` + 3 `review_artifacts` passed.\n  - `cargo run --package xtask -- docs-images`: rendered all 13 PNGs (`1200x760`, 126 KB-196 KB) and passed `--check`.\n  - `cargo clippy -p xtask -p camcraft-ui --all-targets -- -D warnings`: green, 0 warnings.\n  - `cargo run --package xtask -- gate quick --base upstream/main`: green (`ui suites` 20s, `xtask unit tests` 31s, 0 failed).\n- Mutations:\n  - Removed `Some(\"docs-images\")` dispatch in `xtask/src/main.rs`: `cargo test -p xtask --test docs_images` failed (`docs_images_check_verifies_guide_pngs_and_manifest`, `docs_images_refuses_unknown_option_by_name`); restored -> all 4 passed.\n  - Weakened `MIN_WIDTH` (`1000` -> `1`) and alt-word check (`<= 4` -> `== 999_999`) in `xtask/src/docs_images.rs`: `cargo test -p xtask docs_images` failed (`narrow_png_width_is_refused`, `short_alt_text_is_refused`); restored -> all passed.\n\n## Goldens moved\n\n- None (`.nc`, `.cl`, and `crates/ui/tests/snapshots/*.png` unchanged).\n\n## Not exercised\n\n- Direct `python3` unittest and `zola build` execution of `site/tests/test_guide_images.py` were skipped because standalone `python3`/`zola` shell invocations are blocked in the headless runner; equivalent URL, demo project, CSS, PNG header/size, and alt-text checks ran in `cargo xtask docs-images --check` and `xtask/tests/docs_images.rs`.\n\n## Overlaps\n\n- Touches the same file, different functions/lines (whichever merges second refreshes):\n  - `site/static/style.css`: PR #2046\n  - `xtask/src/main.rs`: PR #1952, PR #2060\n  - `crates/ui/src/egui_app/tests.rs`: PR #1209, PR #1330, PR #1685, PR #1753, PR #1931, PR #1938, PR #1996, PR #2023, PR #2027, PR #2029, PR #2036, PR #2068\n\nProcess change: yes\n\nChangelog: Render 13 reproducible User Guide screenshots from CamCraft demo projects via cargo xtask docs-images.\n\nFixes #1902\n",
